musb omap2430: run omap2430_low_level_init() at the end of omap2430_musb_init().
A rebind's exit leaves MSTANDBY forced, and only a runtime resume clears it,
which a glue that stays active across the rebind never gets: the Inventra DMA
engine then cannot reach memory and transfers never complete. Needed because
the project's USB RESCAN does an unbind+bind of musb-hdrc.
Applies to pristine v7.3.4; 0005 is based on this one.

--- a/drivers/usb/musb/omap2430.c	2026-11-15 11:37:04.928905547 -0500
+++ b/drivers/usb/musb/omap2430.c	2026-11-15 11:37:04.928905547 -0500
@@ -237,6 +237,12 @@
 
 	musb_writel(musb->mregs, OTG_INTERFSEL, l);
 
+	/* A rebind's exit left MSTANDBY forced and only a runtime resume
+	 * clears it, which a glue still active across the rebind never gets:
+	 * the Inventra DMA engine then cannot reach memory and never completes.
+	 */
+	omap2430_low_level_init(musb);
+
 	dev_dbg(dev, "HS USB OTG: revision 0x%x, sysconfig 0x%02x, "
 			"sysstatus 0x%x, intrfsel 0x%x, simenable  0x%x\n",
 			musb_readl(musb->mregs, OTG_REVISION),
